ion:absolute;left:36px;top:32px;\n    display:inline-block;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:2px;\n    background:rgba(79,94,67,.12);border:1px solid rgba(79,94,67,.22);\n    font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3.2px;color:#3F4C38;}\n  .card.c2 .tag{background:rgba(180,145,74,.14);border-color:rgba(180,145,74,.34);color:#7A6229;}\n  .card .ctitle{position:absolute;left:36px;top:88px;font-size:42px;line-height:1.1;\n    font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#1B2620;}\n  .card .cdesc{position:absolute;left:36px;top:154px;width:720px;\n    font-size:21px;line-height:1.5;color:#3F4B44;letter-spacing:.4px;}\n  .card .chips{position:absolute;left:36px;top:226px;display:flex;gap:12px;}\n  .chip{display:inline-block;padding:7px 16px;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.22);\n    border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#4E5A52;background:rgba(245,242,233,.72);}\n\n  /* ---------- bottom note + pager ---------- */\n  .note{position:absolute;left:96px;top:918px;width:1500px;height:32px;z-index:12;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;overflow:hidden;}\n  .note .bar{width:3px;height:22px;background:var(--gold);flex:0 0 auto;}\n  .note p{font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#57635A;letter-spacing:.4px;white-space:nowrap;}\n  .note b{color:#2B3830;font-weight:700;}\n\n  .bottom-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:996px;width:1728px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.14);}\n  .foot-left{position:absolute;left:96px;top:1016px;z-index:12;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2.6px;color:#6D776E;}\n  .page-no{position:absolute;right:96px;top:1010px;z-index:15;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;color:#4F5B53;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-bottom\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">第一天 · 芦汀园与旧街摄影</div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">青岚市周末慢游 · 2 天步行与摄影行程</div>\n  <div class=\"badge\">虚构测评材料</div>\n\n  <div class=\"eyebrow\"><i></i>行程 · 第一天</div>\n  <h1 class=\"title\">第一天：芦汀园与旧街摄影<span class=\"paren\">（步行上限4.6公里）</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">按慢行节奏安排，不额外加景点；下午一段保留机动时间。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"rule2\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"lab\">步行上限</div>\n      <div class=\"val serif\">4.6<span class=\"unit\">公里</span></div>\n      <div class=\"note\">慢行节奏，不加景点</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"lab\">同行人数</div>\n      <div class=\"val serif\">5<span class=\"unit\">人</span></div>\n      <div class=\"note\">统一节奏，不设硬指标</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"lab\">行程状态</div>\n      <div class=\"val serif state\">计划</div>\n      <div class=\"note\">票价开放时间未确定</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-label\"><span class=\"sq\"></span>当日的两段安排</div>\n\n  <div class=\"card c1\">\n    <div class=\"accent\"></div>\n    <div class=\"idx serif\">01</div>\n    <div class=\"tag\">上午</div>\n    <div class=\"ctitle serif\">芦汀园</div>\n    <div class=\"cdesc\">以园内步行为主，配合拍照。</div>\n    <div class=\"chips\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">园内步行</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">拍照</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card c2\">\n    <div class=\"accent\"></div>\n    <div class=\"idx serif\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"tag\">下午</div>\n    <div class=\"ctitle serif\">旧街</div>\n    <div class=\"cdesc\">街拍与慢走，保留机动时间。</div>\n    <div class=\"chips\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">街拍</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">慢走</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">机动时间</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">\n    <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n    <p>状态：<b>计划</b>；开放时间与票价未确定，资料未提供。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"foot-left\">青岚市及全部景点均为虚构 · 不对应真实票价与开放时间</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\">3 / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"Need to fix div.note overflow. We have .note at top:920 with p font 18px, and inside strip cells there are .note class too! Wait — class \"note\" is used both in cells and the bottom note. The instruction says \"修复 div.note 纵向溢出：将三处注释文本压缩为每处不超过12字的单行短语\". Hmm, \"三处注释\" — which three? Possibly the three cell notes (strip cells each have .note). Actually the strip cells `.cell .note` have notes: \"按慢行节奏安排，不额外加景点\" (13 chars), \"统一节奏，不设置集合时限以外的硬指标\" (long), \"开放时间与票价未确定，资料未提供\" (15 chars). Those wrap to multiple lines and may overflow the 158px strip. So \"三处注释\" likely refers to the three cell notes. Compress each to ≤12 chars single line.\n\nCell notes:\n1. \"按慢行节奏安排，不额外加景点\" → \"慢行节奏，不加景点\" (9 chars) — good, keeps meaning.\n2. \"统一节奏，不设置集合时限以外的硬指标\" → \"统一节奏，不设硬指标\" (10 chars).\n3. \"开放时间与票价未确定，资料未提供\" → \"票价与开放时间未定\" (10 chars) or \"票价开放时间未确定\" (10 chars). Must retain \"未确定\" wording? The constraint says不得改动 \"计划/未确定\" 表述 — the bottom note keeps 状态：计划；...未确定... Let's keep cell note as \"票价与开放时间未定\" — hmm \"未定\" vs \"未确定\". Safer: \"票价开放时间未确定\" (9 chars). Good.\n\nAlso the bottom div.note: keep as is? It's single line probably fits. But instruction: \"同时降低注释字号或调整容器高度，确保全部内容在画布内不溢出\". Reduce cell .note font-size to 15px already; set white-space:nowrap; and maybe add ellipsis no. Keep font-size 16px, nowrap.\n\nAlso the cell padding: 24px top, val 46px with margin 12, note margin 12. Height 158. 24+ (14*1.?)... let's compute: lab 14px line ~20; val margin-top 12 + 46*1.05≈48; note margin-top 12 + 16*1.45≈23. Total = 24+20+12+48+12+23 = 139 < 158. OK.\n\nAlso bottom note: single line nowrap, font-size 17px, at top 920 fine; bottom-rule at 996. Fine.\n\nAlso ensure note text nowrap and no overflow horizontally: longest nowrap \"统一节奏，不设硬指标\" fits in cell width (~576 - padding).\n\nLet me also keep the strip; maybe widen? No need.\n\nAlso the bottom note p: keep \"状态：计划；开放时间与票价未确定，资料未提供。\" It's ≤ about 22 chars at 17px ≈ 380px, fits within 1500px. Nowrap.\n\nAlso need to double check the title fits within width 1600 at 58px: title \"第一天：芦汀园与旧街摄影（步行上限4.6公里）\" ~ 22 chars * ~58 = 1270 plus paren smaller. Fits.\n\nOutput the full HTML.\n\nAdd .cell .note{white-space:nowrap;font-size:16px;} and maybe overflow hidden. Also .note p{white-space:nowrap}.\n\nBut wait — the bottom .note shares class with cell notes; the rule `.cell .note` is scoped, fine. `.note p` scoped to p inside .note; cell notes are divs without p. Fine.\n\nLet me write final."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10225,"completion_tokens":4512,"total_tokens":14737,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":6400},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":833},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":6400,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3825},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}